      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**First and last frame**\n\n1. The top **Load Image** is the first picture, the bottom one is the last picture. Sample stills are loaded, so you can press **Run** right away.\n2. To use your own, click the picture name in each **Load Image** box and pick a file.\n3. Press **Run**. The clip starts on the first picture and ends on the last one.\n\nA last frame always needs a first frame. Only generated video is charged."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**First and last frame**\n\n1. The top **Load Image** is the first picture, the bottom one is the last picture. Sample stills are loaded, so you can press **Run** right away.\n2. To use your own, click the picture name in each **Load Image** box and pick a file.\n3. Press **Run**. The clip starts on the first picture and ends on the last one.\n\nA last frame always needs a first frame. Only generated video is charged."
      },
